{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":259228,\"title\":\"Kidnapping Assemblyman Mr. Clean\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Since Hee-Kyung’s (Jeon Mi-Sun) husband died, she has raised her son and daughter by herself. She runs a small restaurant. but a construction company wants the residents including Hee-Kyung, Young-Ran (Kim Hyun-Sook) and Seul-Ki (Lee Soo-Kyung) out of there.\\n\\nHee-Kyung and other residents meet with Lawmaker Na Chung-Ryeom (Son Jong-Hak) and ask him for help. Lawmaker Na Chung-Ryeom comforts them and promises to meet with the construction company CEO. At night, hired gangsters come and destroy the area. Later, Hee-Kyung, Young-Ran and Seul-Ki learn that Lawmaker Na Chung-Ryeom’s schemed to kick the residents out of the area. Hee-Kyung, Young-Ran and Seul-Ki decide to kidnap the lawmaker.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a3lou8vUNlIkVDBTxYF1lQQVVrc.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/11Cv9yT7IF9VRz4ZwuU9bvTL1hk.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":4,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2016,\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":1,\"totalEpisodes\":2,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"SBS\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"KR\",\"name\":\"South Korea\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2016-04-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":994248,\"name\":\"Jeon Mi-seon\",\"character\":\"Hee Kyung\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yokn7BRVQEhn4jn6MluG75wVbAk.jpg\"},{\"id\":1335771,\"name\":\"Kim Hyun-sook\",\"character\":\"Young Ran\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7m4Hr4M1VpjK3AHoYoNfQW1fWu3.jpg\"},{\"id\":1482875,\"name\":\"Lee Soo-kyung\",\"character\":\"Seul Gi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5an5tKfx3U2UUEN5uck2W1KfZS.jpg\"},{\"id\":2804996,\"name\":\"Jung Sung-il\",\"character\":\"Department Head Kim\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3VyIhJniatsImjmBJlkclPZJsEE.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"He-z_L1rGEA\",\"name\":\"Of